{"schema_version":"m2-source-0.1","proof_id":"B01","theorem_version":1,"domain":"elementary_algebra","theorem":"证明两个能被 3 整除的整数之和仍能被 3 整除。","assumptions":["a,b 为整数，且 3|a、3|b。"],"proof_steps":[{"node_id":"n1","text":"存在整数 m,n，使 a=3m，b=3n。"},{"node_id":"n2","text":"于是 a+b=3m+3n=3(m+n)。"},{"node_id":"n3","text":"因为 m+n 是整数，所以 3|a+b。"}]}
{"schema_version":"m2-source-0.1","proof_id":"B02","theorem_version":1,"domain":"elementary_algebra","theorem":"证明奇整数的平方仍为奇数。","assumptions":["n 为奇整数。"],"proof_steps":[{"node_id":"n1","text":"存在整数 k，使 n=2k+1。"},{"node_id":"n2","text":"平方得 n^2=4k^2+4k+1=2(2k^2+2k)+1。"},{"node_id":"n3","text":"因为 2k^2+2k 是整数，所以 n^2 为奇数。"}]}
{"schema_version":"m2-source-0.1","proof_id":"B03","theorem_version":1,"domain":"elementary_algebra","theorem":"证明两个有理数之差仍为有理数。","assumptions":["x,y 为有理数。"],"proof_steps":[{"node_id":"n1","text":"存在整数 p,q,r,s，且 q≠0、s≠0，使 x=p/q，y=r/s。"},{"node_id":"n2","text":"于是 x-y=(ps-rq)/(qs)。"},{"node_id":"n3","text":"ps-rq 与 qs 都是整数，并且 qs≠0。"},{"node_id":"n4","text":"因此 x-y 是有理数。"}]}
{"schema_version":"m2-source-0.1","proof_id":"B04","theorem_version":1,"domain":"elementary_algebra","theorem":"证明对任意实数 x，都有 |x|≥0。","assumptions":["x 为实数。"],"proof_steps":[{"node_id":"n1","text":"若 x≥0，则按绝对值定义有 |x|=x≥0。"},{"node_id":"n2","text":"若 x<0，则 |x|=-x>0。"},{"node_id":"n3","text":"两种情形覆盖所有实数，所以 |x|≥0。"}]}
{"schema_version":"m2-source-0.1","proof_id":"B05","theorem_version":1,"domain":"elementary_algebra","theorem":"证明若整数 a|b，则 a^3|b^3。","assumptions":["a,b 为整数，且 a|b。"],"proof_steps":[{"node_id":"n1","text":"存在整数 k，使 b=ak。"},{"node_id":"n2","text":"两边立方得到 b^3=a^3k^3。"},{"node_id":"n3","text":"因为 k^3 是整数，所以 a^3|b^3。"}]}
{"schema_version":"m2-source-0.1","proof_id":"B06","theorem_version":1,"domain":"elementary_algebra","theorem":"证明若 0<a<b，则 1/a>1/b。","assumptions":["a,b 为实数，且 0<a<b。"],"proof_steps":[{"node_id":"n1","text":"因为 a,b 都为正数，所以 ab>0。"},{"node_id":"n2","text":"在 a<b 两边同除以正数 ab，不等号方向保持不变。"},{"node_id":"n3","text":"得到 1/b<1/a，即 1/a>1/b。"}]}
{"schema_version":"m2-source-0.1","proof_id":"B07","theorem_version":1,"domain":"elementary_algebra","theorem":"证明任意三个连续整数的乘积能被 6 整除。","assumptions":["n 为整数，三个连续整数为 n,n+1,n+2。"],"proof_steps":[{"node_id":"n1","text":"三个连续整数中至少有一个是偶数，所以乘积能被 2 整除。"},{"node_id":"n2","text":"三个连续整数除以 3 的余数依次覆盖 0、1、2，所以其中一个能被 3 整除。"},{"node_id":"n3","text":"2 与 3 互素，因此该乘积能被 6 整除。"}]}
{"schema_version":"m2-source-0.1","proof_id":"B08","theorem_version":1,"domain":"elementary_algebra","theorem":"证明若两个整数之和为奇数，则它们一奇一偶。","assumptions":["a,b 为整数，且 a+b 为奇数。"],"proof_steps":[{"node_id":"n1","text":"若 a,b 都为偶数，则 a+b 为偶数。"},{"node_id":"n2","text":"若 a,b 都为奇数，则 a+b 也为偶数。"},{"node_id":"n3","text":"这两种同奇偶情形都与 a+b 为奇数矛盾。"},{"node_id":"n4","text":"因此 a,b 的奇偶性不同，即一奇一偶。"}]}
{"schema_version":"m2-source-0.1","proof_id":"B09","theorem_version":1,"domain":"elementary_algebra","theorem":"证明对任意实数 x，x^2-4x+4≥0。","assumptions":["x 为实数。"],"proof_steps":[{"node_id":"n1","text":"配方得 x^2-4x+4=(x-2)^2。"},{"node_id":"n2","text":"实数的平方非负，所以 (x-2)^2≥0。"},{"node_id":"n3","text":"因此 x^2-4x+4≥0。"}]}
{"schema_version":"m2-source-0.1","proof_id":"B10","theorem_version":1,"domain":"elementary_algebra","theorem":"证明若 a|b 且 c|d，则 ac|bd。","assumptions":["a,b,c,d 为整数，且 a|b、c|d。"],"proof_steps":[{"node_id":"n1","text":"存在整数 m,n，使 b=am，d=cn。"},{"node_id":"n2","text":"于是 bd=(am)(cn)=ac(mn)。"},{"node_id":"n3","text":"因为 mn 是整数，所以 ac|bd。"}]}
{"schema_version":"m2-source-0.1","proof_id":"B11","theorem_version":1,"domain":"elementary_algebra","theorem":"证明两个能被 4 整除的整数之和仍能被 4 整除。","assumptions":["a,b 为整数，且 4|a、4|b。"],"proof_steps":[{"node_id":"n1","text":"存在整数 m,n，使 a=4m，b=4n。"},{"node_id":"n2","text":"因此 4|a+b。"}]}
{"schema_version":"m2-source-0.1","proof_id":"B12","theorem_version":1,"domain":"elementary_algebra","theorem":"证明若实数 x>3，则 x^2>9。","assumptions":["x 为实数且 x>3。"],"proof_steps":[{"node_id":"n1","text":"由 x>3 可知 x-3>0。"},{"node_id":"n2","text":"因此 x^2-9>0。"},{"node_id":"n3","text":"所以 x^2>9。"}]}
{"schema_version":"m2-source-0.1","proof_id":"B13","theorem_version":1,"domain":"elementary_algebra","theorem":"证明任意奇整数 n 都满足 n^2 除以 8 余 1。","assumptions":["n 为奇整数。"],"proof_steps":[{"node_id":"n1","text":"存在整数 k，使 n=2k+1。"},{"node_id":"n2","text":"于是 n^2=4k(k+1)+1。"},{"node_id":"n3","text":"所以 n^2 除以 8 余 1。"}]}
{"schema_version":"m2-source-0.1","proof_id":"B14","theorem_version":1,"domain":"elementary_algebra","theorem":"证明两个有理数的乘积仍为有理数。","assumptions":["x,y 为有理数。"],"proof_steps":[{"node_id":"n1","text":"写成 x=p/q，y=r/s，其中 p,q,r,s 为整数。"},{"node_id":"n2","text":"于是 xy=pr/(qs)。"},{"node_id":"n3","text":"因此 xy 是有理数。"}]}
{"schema_version":"m2-source-0.1","proof_id":"B15","theorem_version":1,"domain":"elementary_algebra","theorem":"证明若整数 a|b，则对任意整数 c 都有 a|bc。","assumptions":["a,b,c 为整数，且 a|b。"],"proof_steps":[{"node_id":"n1","text":"由 a|b，存在整数 k 使 b=ak。"},{"node_id":"n2","text":"所以 a|bc。"}]}
{"schema_version":"m2-source-0.1","proof_id":"B16","theorem_version":1,"domain":"elementary_algebra","theorem":"证明若实数 a<b，则 a<(a+b)/2<b。","assumptions":["a,b 为实数且 a<b。"],"proof_steps":[{"node_id":"n1","text":"由 a<b 可知 2a<a+b，并且 a+b<2b。"},{"node_id":"n2","text":"因此 a<(a+b)/2<b。"}]}
{"schema_version":"m2-source-0.1","proof_id":"B17","theorem_version":1,"domain":"elementary_algebra","theorem":"证明若正实数 a,b 满足 a^2=b^2，则 a=b。","assumptions":["a,b 为正实数，且 a^2=b^2。"],"proof_steps":[{"node_id":"n1","text":"由 a^2=b^2 得 (a-b)(a+b)=0。"},{"node_id":"n2","text":"因此 a=b。"}]}
{"schema_version":"m2-source-0.1","proof_id":"B18","theorem_version":1,"domain":"elementary_algebra","theorem":"证明任意五个连续整数之和能被 5 整除。","assumptions":["n 为整数，五个连续整数为 n,n+1,n+2,n+3,n+4。"],"proof_steps":[{"node_id":"n1","text":"将这五个连续整数相加。"},{"node_id":"n2","text":"所得结果是 5 的倍数。"},{"node_id":"n3","text":"因此它们的和能被 5 整除。"}]}
{"schema_version":"m2-source-0.1","proof_id":"B19","theorem_version":1,"domain":"elementary_algebra","theorem":"证明偶整数的立方仍为偶数。","assumptions":["n 为偶整数。"],"proof_steps":[{"node_id":"n1","text":"存在整数 k，使 n=2k。"},{"node_id":"n2","text":"所以 n^3 为偶数。"}]}
{"schema_version":"m2-source-0.1","proof_id":"B20","theorem_version":1,"domain":"elementary_algebra","theorem":"证明若两个整数之和为偶数，则这两个整数同奇偶。","assumptions":["a,b 为整数，且 a+b 为偶数。"],"proof_steps":[{"node_id":"n1","text":"若 a 为偶数，则 b 为偶数；若 a 为奇数，则 b 为奇数。"},{"node_id":"n2","text":"因此 a,b 同奇偶。"}]}
{"schema_version":"m2-source-0.1","proof_id":"B21","theorem_version":1,"domain":"elementary_algebra","theorem":"证明若整数 n^2 为偶数，则 n 为偶数。","assumptions":["n 为整数，且 n^2 为偶数。"],"proof_steps":[{"node_id":"n1","text":"因为待证结论是 n 为偶数，所以设 n=2k。"},{"node_id":"n2","text":"于是 n^2=4k^2 为偶数。"},{"node_id":"n3","text":"这与假设一致，所以 n 为偶数。"}]}
{"schema_version":"m2-source-0.1","proof_id":"B22","theorem_version":1,"domain":"elementary_algebra","theorem":"证明若 0≤y<x，则 y^2<x^2。","assumptions":["x,y 为实数，且 0≤y<x。"],"proof_steps":[{"node_id":"n1","text":"由 0≤y<x 可知 x+y>0。"},{"node_id":"n2","text":"所以 y^2<x^2。"}]}
{"schema_version":"m2-source-0.1","proof_id":"B23","theorem_version":1,"domain":"elementary_algebra","theorem":"证明若整数 a|b 且 b|c，则 a|c。","assumptions":["a,b,c 为整数，且 a|b、b|c。"],"proof_steps":[{"node_id":"n1","text":"由 a|b 可知 b 是 a 的倍数。"},{"node_id":"n2","text":"因此 c 是 a 的倍数。"},{"node_id":"n3","text":"所以 a|c。"}]}
{"schema_version":"m2-source-0.1","proof_id":"B24","theorem_version":1,"domain":"elementary_algebra","theorem":"证明若实数 |x|<1，则 x^2<1。","assumptions":["x 为实数，且 |x|<1。"],"proof_steps":[{"node_id":"n1","text":"任意实数的平方都非负，所以 x^2≥0。"},{"node_id":"n2","text":"因此 x^2<1。"}]}
{"schema_version":"m2-source-0.1","proof_id":"B25","theorem_version":1,"domain":"elementary_algebra","theorem":"证明两个奇整数之和为偶数。","assumptions":["a,b 为奇整数。"],"proof_steps":[{"node_id":"n1","text":"例如 1+3=4 是偶数。"},{"node_id":"n2","text":"同理，任意两个奇整数之和都是偶数。"}]}
{"schema_version":"m2-source-0.1","proof_id":"B26","theorem_version":1,"domain":"elementary_algebra","theorem":"证明对实数 a,b，有 ab=0 当且仅当 a=0 或 b=0。","assumptions":["a,b 为实数。"],"proof_steps":[{"node_id":"n1","text":"若 a=0 或 b=0，则 ab=0。"},{"node_id":"n2","text":"所以 ab=0 当且仅当 a=0 或 b=0。"}]}
{"schema_version":"m2-source-0.1","proof_id":"B27","theorem_version":1,"domain":"elementary_algebra","theorem":"证明对任意整数 n，n^2-n 是偶数。","assumptions":["n 为整数。"],"proof_steps":[{"node_id":"n1","text":"n^2 与 n 具有相同的奇偶性。"},{"node_id":"n2","text":"因此 n^2-n 是偶数。"}]}
{"schema_version":"m2-source-0.1","proof_id":"B28","theorem_version":1,"domain":"elementary_algebra","theorem":"证明若 0<a<b，则 a^2<b^2。","assumptions":["a,b 为实数，且 0<a<b。"],"proof_steps":[{"node_id":"n1","text":"a^2 与 b^2 都是正数。"},{"node_id":"n2","text":"因此 a^2<b^2。"}]}
{"schema_version":"m2-source-0.1","proof_id":"B29","theorem_version":1,"domain":"elementary_algebra","theorem":"证明若整数 n 能被 10 整除，则 n 能被 5 整除。","assumptions":["n 为整数，且 10|n。"],"proof_steps":[{"node_id":"n1","text":"10 与 5 都是正整数，而且 10>5。"},{"node_id":"n2","text":"因此 5|n。"}]}
{"schema_version":"m2-source-0.1","proof_id":"B30","theorem_version":1,"domain":"elementary_algebra","theorem":"证明若实数 x=y，则 x^3+2x=y^3+2y。","assumptions":["x,y 为实数，且 x=y。"],"proof_steps":[{"node_id":"n1","text":"由 x=y 可知 x^2=y^2。"},{"node_id":"n2","text":"因此 x^3+2x=y^3+2y。"}]}
{"schema_version":"m2-source-0.1","proof_id":"B31","theorem_version":1,"domain":"elementary_algebra","theorem":"证明两个偶整数之和为偶数。","assumptions":["a,b 为偶整数。"],"proof_steps":[{"node_id":"n1","text":"每个偶整数都能被 4 整除。"},{"node_id":"n2","text":"所以存在整数 m,n，使 a=4m，b=4n。"},{"node_id":"n3","text":"于是 a+b=4(m+n)，从而 a+b 为偶数。"}]}
{"schema_version":"m2-source-0.1","proof_id":"B32","theorem_version":1,"domain":"elementary_algebra","theorem":"证明奇整数的平方为奇数。","assumptions":["n 为奇整数。"],"proof_steps":[{"node_id":"n1","text":"每个奇整数都可以写成 n=4k+1。"},{"node_id":"n2","text":"于是 n^2=(4k+1)^2=16k^2+8k+1。"},{"node_id":"n3","text":"所以 n^2 为奇数。"}]}
{"schema_version":"m2-source-0.1","proof_id":"B33","theorem_version":1,"domain":"elementary_algebra","theorem":"证明若实数 x>1，则 x^2>x。","assumptions":["x 为实数且 x>1。"],"proof_steps":[{"node_id":"n1","text":"对所有 x>1，都有 x^2>2x。"},{"node_id":"n2","text":"又因为 2x>x，所以 x^2>x。"}]}
{"schema_version":"m2-source-0.1","proof_id":"B34","theorem_version":1,"domain":"elementary_algebra","theorem":"证明两个有理数之和为有理数。","assumptions":["x,y 为有理数。"],"proof_steps":[{"node_id":"n1","text":"写 x=p/q，y=r/s，其中 p,q,r,s 为整数且 q,s≠0。"},{"node_id":"n2","text":"两个分数相加有 x+y=(p+r)/(qs)。"},{"node_id":"n3","text":"分子分母都是整数且分母非零，所以 x+y 是有理数。"}]}
{"schema_version":"m2-source-0.1","proof_id":"B35","theorem_version":1,"domain":"elementary_algebra","theorem":"证明若整数 a|b，则 a|b^2。","assumptions":["a,b 为整数，且 a|b。"],"proof_steps":[{"node_id":"n1","text":"存在整数 k，使 b=ak。"},{"node_id":"n2","text":"于是 b^2=ak^2。"},{"node_id":"n3","text":"因为 k^2 是整数，所以 a|b^2。"}]}
{"schema_version":"m2-source-0.1","proof_id":"B36","theorem_version":1,"domain":"elementary_algebra","theorem":"证明对任意实数 x,y，都有 |xy|=|x||y|。","assumptions":["x,y 为实数。"],"proof_steps":[{"node_id":"n1","text":"对任意实数 x,y，都有 |x+y|=|x|+|y|。"},{"node_id":"n2","text":"把加法换成乘法，同样得到 |xy|=|x||y|。"}]}
{"schema_version":"m2-source-0.1","proof_id":"B37","theorem_version":1,"domain":"elementary_algebra","theorem":"证明任意四个连续整数的乘积能被 24 整除。","assumptions":["n 为整数，四个连续整数为 n,n+1,n+2,n+3。"],"proof_steps":[{"node_id":"n1","text":"四个连续整数中的第一个或第二个一定能被 4 整除。"},{"node_id":"n2","text":"其中至少两个是偶数，并且至少一个能被 3 整除。"},{"node_id":"n3","text":"因此四个数的乘积能被 24 整除。"}]}
{"schema_version":"m2-source-0.1","proof_id":"B38","theorem_version":1,"domain":"elementary_algebra","theorem":"证明两个奇整数的乘积为奇数。","assumptions":["a,b 为奇整数。"],"proof_steps":[{"node_id":"n1","text":"两个奇整数的乘积除以 4 总是余 1。"},{"node_id":"n2","text":"因此 ab 不能被 2 整除，所以 ab 为奇数。"}]}
{"schema_version":"m2-source-0.1","proof_id":"B39","theorem_version":1,"domain":"elementary_algebra","theorem":"证明若实数 x^2=y^2，则 |x|=|y|。","assumptions":["x,y 为实数，且 x^2=y^2。"],"proof_steps":[{"node_id":"n1","text":"由 x^2=y^2 可知 x=y。"},{"node_id":"n2","text":"所以 |x|=|y|。"}]}
{"schema_version":"m2-source-0.1","proof_id":"B40","theorem_version":1,"domain":"elementary_algebra","theorem":"证明若整数 n 能被 6 整除，则 n^2 能被 12 整除。","assumptions":["n 为整数，且 6|n。"],"proof_steps":[{"node_id":"n1","text":"由 6|n 可知 12|n。"},{"node_id":"n2","text":"因此存在整数 k，使 n=12k。"},{"node_id":"n3","text":"于是 n^2=144k^2，所以 12|n^2。"}]}
{"schema_version":"m2-source-0.1","proof_id":"B41","theorem_version":1,"domain":"elementary_algebra","theorem":"证明方程 x^2=x 的实数解为 x=0 或 x=1。","assumptions":["x 为实数且 x^2=x。"],"proof_steps":[{"node_id":"n1","text":"由 x^2=x 得 x(x-1)=0。"},{"node_id":"n2","text":"等式两边约去 x，得到 x-1=0。"},{"node_id":"n3","text":"所以 x=0 或 x=1。"}]}
{"schema_version":"m2-source-0.1","proof_id":"B42","theorem_version":1,"domain":"elementary_algebra","theorem":"证明对任意实数 a，都有 sqrt(a^2)=|a|。","assumptions":["a 为实数。"],"proof_steps":[{"node_id":"n1","text":"平方与开平方互相抵消，所以 sqrt(a^2)=a。"},{"node_id":"n2","text":"因此 sqrt(a^2)=|a|。"}]}
{"schema_version":"m2-source-0.1","proof_id":"B43","theorem_version":1,"domain":"elementary_algebra","theorem":"证明若实数 a<b 且 c<0，则 ac>bc。","assumptions":["a,b,c 为实数，且 a<b、c<0。"],"proof_steps":[{"node_id":"n1","text":"在 a<b 两边乘以 c，不等号方向保持不变，得到 ac<bc。"},{"node_id":"n2","text":"所以 ac>bc。"}]}
{"schema_version":"m2-source-0.1","proof_id":"B44","theorem_version":1,"domain":"elementary_algebra","theorem":"证明若整数 a|bc，则 a|b 或 a|c。","assumptions":["a,b,c 为整数，且 a|bc。"],"proof_steps":[{"node_id":"n1","text":"由欧几里得引理可知，只要 a|bc，就有 a|b 或 a|c。"},{"node_id":"n2","text":"因此结论成立。"}]}
{"schema_version":"m2-source-0.1","proof_id":"B45","theorem_version":1,"domain":"elementary_algebra","theorem":"证明若实数 a=b，则 (a+2)^2=(b+2)^2。","assumptions":["a,b 为实数，且 a=b。"],"proof_steps":[{"node_id":"n1","text":"展开得 (a+2)^2=a^2+2a+4，(b+2)^2=b^2+2b+4。"},{"node_id":"n2","text":"因为 a=b，所以两个展开式相等。"},{"node_id":"n3","text":"因此 (a+2)^2=(b+2)^2。"}]}
{"schema_version":"m2-source-0.1","proof_id":"B46","theorem_version":1,"domain":"elementary_algebra","theorem":"证明两个有理数之和为有理数。","assumptions":["x=p/q，y=r/s，其中 p,q,r,s 为整数且 q,s≠0。"],"proof_steps":[{"node_id":"n1","text":"异分母分数相加得到 x+y=(ps+rq)/(q+s)。"},{"node_id":"n2","text":"分子和分母都是整数，所以 x+y 是有理数。"}]}
{"schema_version":"m2-source-0.1","proof_id":"B47","theorem_version":1,"domain":"elementary_algebra","theorem":"用数学归纳法证明 1+2+...+n=n(n+1)/2。","assumptions":["n 为正整数。"],"proof_steps":[{"node_id":"n1","text":"当 n=1 时，1=1(1+1)/2，命题成立。"},{"node_id":"n2","text":"假设 1+2+...+n=n(n+1)/2。"},{"node_id":"n3","text":"则加上 n+1 后，总和为 n(n+1)/2+(n+1)=(n+1)^2/2。"},{"node_id":"n4","text":"所以 n+1 时命题也成立，归纳完成。"}]}
{"schema_version":"m2-source-0.1","proof_id":"B48","theorem_version":1,"domain":"elementary_algebra","theorem":"证明若实数 a=b，则对任意实数 c 都有 a/c=b/c。","assumptions":["a,b,c 为实数，且 a=b。"],"proof_steps":[{"node_id":"n1","text":"等式两边同时除以 c。"},{"node_id":"n2","text":"得到 a/c=b/c。"}]}
{"schema_version":"m2-source-0.1","proof_id":"B49","theorem_version":1,"domain":"elementary_algebra","theorem":"证明对非负实数 a,b，有 sqrt(a+b)≤sqrt(a)+sqrt(b)。","assumptions":["a,b 为非负实数。"],"proof_steps":[{"node_id":"n1","text":"根据根式加法公式，有 sqrt(a+b)=sqrt(a)+sqrt(b)。"},{"node_id":"n2","text":"因此 sqrt(a+b)≤sqrt(a)+sqrt(b)。"}]}
{"schema_version":"m2-source-0.1","proof_id":"B50","theorem_version":1,"domain":"elementary_algebra","theorem":"证明若实数 a<b，则 a^3<b^3。","assumptions":["a,b 为实数，且 a<b。"],"proof_steps":[{"node_id":"n1","text":"由 a<b 可知 a^2<b^2。"},{"node_id":"n2","text":"再分别乘以 a 和 b，得到 a^3<b^3。"},{"node_id":"n3","text":"因此立方函数严格递增。"}]}
